Description: Modern Linux Router & Next-Gen Firewall
 Axonwall replaces legacy BSD/PHP firewalls with a
 modern reactive architecture built on Linux nftables, Next.js, Supabase,
 OpenLDAP, and a privileged Go daemon with commit-confirm transaction safety.
